      "id": "claim_4f125b1dee9d451f9348548f978dda27",
      "statement": "cqg evaluates intrinsic document quality before RAG ingestion and is reference-free and document-level: it requires neither ground truth nor a query workload, scoring each document on its own observable properties and aggregating to a corpus verdict.",
